{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not publish success or PENDING after fatal MDC restoration failure.** This `finally` completes the caller\u2019s future even when `restore.close()` throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` on an asynchronous executor. The caller receives a normal durable response while only the worker dies. Capture the close failure, complete the caller exceptionally with the fatal before rethrowing it, and publish the selected outcome only after restoration succeeds.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ki2f","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":281,"observation_digest":"44ae908d464fa797d7ff5b2ebe43dc1198faaa81a1989a3ff37f73b6d4ea79c4","observation_id":"aro_v1_isxjbdkgj6tzpv77lmxl4q64cg","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:25Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5yebu2crhve2yvxvednu65a4hs","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"14db8ae956d155999450c9262eec78bf71d38bdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":278,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_d7vs4uwgnjktax62dxguihckcb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:25Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
